_k",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#233-sqrtd_k","children":"왜 sqrt(d_k)로 나누는가"}]}],["$","li","234-self-attention-cross-attention",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#234-self-attention-cross-attention","children":"셀프 어텐션과 크로스 어텐션"}]}],["$","li","235",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#235","children":"위치 정보"}]}],["$","li","236-mask",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#236-mask","children":"마스크"}]}],["$","li","237-transformer-encoder",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#237-transformer-encoder","children":"Transformer 인코더의 최소 코드"}]}],["$","li","238",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#238","children":"계산량과 시험 선택"}]}],["$","li","239",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#239","children":"손계산 예제"}]}],["$","li","2310",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#2310","children":"실습문제"}]}],["$","li","2311",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#2311","children":"완료 기준"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"toc-group-label","children":"기초 확인과 해설"}],["$","ol",null,{"children":[["$","li","visual-23-7",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#visual-23-7","children":"스스로 확인하기"}]}],["$","li","visual-23-8",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#visual-23-8","children":"정답과 이유"}]}],["$","li","visual-23-9",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#visual-23-9","children":"더 읽을 공식 자료"}]}]]}]]]}]
